<title>USA: USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - July 22.</title>
<headline>USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - July 22.</headline>
<text>
<p>Est daily livestock slaughter under Fed inspection - USDA</p>
<p>					  Cattle	 Calves    Hogs</p>
<p>Tuesday    07/22/97 (est)	 132,000	5,000     343,000</p>
<p>Week ago (est)			132,000	5,000     338,000</p>
<p>Year ago (act)			133,000	8,000     326,000</p>
<p>Week to date (est)		  256,000     11,000     623,000</p>
<p>Same Period Last Week (est)     258,000     11,000     629,000</p>
<p>Same Period Last Year (est)     262,000     15,000     633,000</p>
<p>Previous Day Estimated     Steer and Heifer	 Cow and Bull</p>
<p>Monday				  104,000		     20,000</p>
<p>* USDA revised Monday (07/21/97) cattle slaughter to 124,000 head from 127,000.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
